  "question": {
    "text": "Consider the region $R=\\left\\{(x, y): x \\leq y \\leq 9-\\frac{11}{3} x^2, x \\geq 0\\right\\}$.\nThe area, of the largest rectangle of sides parallel to the coordinate axes and inscribed in R , is:"
  },
