  "solution": {
    "text": "$\\mathrm{t} .\\left(9-\\frac{11 \\mathrm{t}^2}{3}-\\mathrm{t}\\right)$\n\n<img src=\"assets\\st0012_a47c7eeee6d9.png\"><br>\n\n\n\n$\\begin{aligned} & \\mathrm{A}=9 \\mathrm{t}-\\mathrm{t}^2-\\frac{11}{3} \\mathrm{t}^3 \\\\ & \\frac{\\mathrm{dA}}{\\mathrm{dt}}=9-2 \\mathrm{t}-11 \\mathrm{t}^2 \\\\ & \\Rightarrow 11 \\mathrm{t}^2+2 \\mathrm{t}-9=0 \\\\ & 11 \\mathrm{t}^2+11 \\mathrm{t}-9 \\mathrm{t}-9=0 \\\\ & \\mathrm{t}=-1 \\& \\mathrm{t}=\\frac{9}{11}\\end{aligned}$<img src=\"assets\\st0012_bd67c3b93ffa.png\"><br>\n\n$\\begin{aligned} & \\therefore \\text { largest area }=\\frac{9}{11}\\left(9-\\frac{11}{3}, \\frac{81}{121}-\\frac{9}{11}\\right) \\\\ & =\\frac{9}{11} \\cdot \\frac{63}{11}=\\frac{567}{121}\\end{aligned}$"
  }
